flowchart LR
    User[用户] --> CLI[miniGit CLI]
    CLI --> Repo[仓库发现与初始化]
    CLI --> Objects[对象库]
    CLI --> Index[索引 / 暂存区]
    CLI --> Refs[引用与修订解析]
    CLI --> Status[状态计算]
    CLI --> Ignore[ignore 规则]
    Index --> Objects
    Objects --> Refs
    Status --> Index
    Status --> Objects
    Status --> Ignore
    Refs --> Objects
